  <section class="about-section">
    <h2><span class="editorial-kicker">01 / The maker</span>Shadoe Myers</h2>
    <div class="about-founder">
      <div class="about-founder-body">
        <p class="about-founder-role">Founder / Developer / Security engineer</p>
        <p>My background is in web development. Today, I'm a security engineer on a corporate incident-response team, where I build automation and internal tools. Penumbra Forge LLC is a one-person studio I started in 2026.</p>
        <p>It came out of a preference for tools that keep data on your own machine when their job permits it and clearly label the network when it does not. The projects here are my attempt at that, and they are still works in progress.</p>
